WEBVTT

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.680
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.890
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:36.070
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.990
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.540
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.830
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.210
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:59.050
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.700
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:27.670
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:31.420
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:50.440
THE GRAND SORCERER MATORIV

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:54.150
Please! You have to help us!

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:57.490
I don't want anything to do with anyone.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.910
Y-You!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:00.740
Hm?

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.530
Uncle Matoriv!

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:04.580
Hmm?

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.120
Oh! You!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.130
Maam?!

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:19.300
Look how you've grown!
You're ripe for motorboarding!

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:20.930
As if!

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:26.020
Calm down.
I've changed your diaper, remember?

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:27.810
Give me a motorboard greeting.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.350
You haven't changed at all, you lech.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.940
Wait, you know this guy, Maam?

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:35.070
I don't just know him. This is...

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:37.650
Matoriv! Now I remember!

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:43.660
A Mage who fought the Dark Lord with the
Hero and served the Papnica royal family!

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:47.080
His name was the Grand Sorcerer Matoriv!

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.540
By Hero, you mean Master Avan?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.960
That's right. Uncle Matoriv was
in Master Avan's party.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.670
How's your mother, Maam?

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:00.050
If she's still single, I can marry her.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:07.770
He used to visit our home a lot,
but I had no idea he was hiding here.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.850
This old lech was in the Hero's party?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:14.820
Normally, I wouldn't want to
see him, but not today.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.190
That's right!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:22.610
No one could be more helpful
than the Grand Sorcerer Matoriv!

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:27.910
Please, Sir Matoriv!
Help us rescue Princess Leona!

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:29.620
Princess?

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:34.380
That's right. The Princess of Papnica
is being held on Valge Island.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.960
I'm sure Sir Matoriv can overcome
the enemy's strange spell!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.050
Please!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:42.380
No thanks.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:43.510
What?!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.600
I said no thanks.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.310
I'm done helping the stupid royal family.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.020
The royal family? Stupid?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:55.150
It's not just the royal family.
It's people in general.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:04:00.780
When the Dark Army was attacking, they'd
butter us up so we'd fight for them.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:05.620
But once peace came, they all suddenly
turned their backs on us.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.370
Sure, I got to be advisor to the king
after the battle was over,

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:15.460
but I was constantly badgered
by the other officials.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.420
I guess they were all
jealous of my skills.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:24.510
That's people for you.
They think about nothing but themselves.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:28.850
I grew tired of all of them
and decided to live in this cave.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.560
I saved you all out of a whim,
but that's as far as it goes.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:40.440
Besides, even if I help you, once it's
over, you'll just forget about me again.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.740
Shoo! Shoo!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.030
That's...

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.700
That's not true.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.620
Dai, you...

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.210
Not everybody thinks
about nothing but themselves!

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:01.550
If you were Master Avan's companion,
you should know that!

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.260
<i>Those eyes...</i>

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:04.720
<i>Avan?!</i>

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:08.090
<i>They have the same eyes.</i>

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.810
And you are?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.770
I'm Dai! Master Avan's last student!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.140
His last?

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.690
Master Avan gave his life to save us!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:26.530
I see. So Avan is dead.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:31.490
That's why we want to avenge his death
by defeating the Dark Army!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.040
Please! Lend us your strength!

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.630
I'm listening.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.560
<i>That's Legendary Forbidden Magic.</i>

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:57.100
<i>I think Flazzard mentioned
something like that.</i>

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:02.900
Forbidden Magic is magic so dirty
that its use is banned.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.740
Anyone who uses it
becomes a pariah among Mages.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:09.280
How can we save Princess Leona?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:12.490
First, you break
the Blizzblaze Curse Field.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:18.120
To do that, you have to approach outside
the field and destroy these two Spires.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.670
You'll need bombs that pack a hefty punch.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.670
Then leave that to me!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.880
Good. You can use
whatever you like for materials.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:33.180
Don't forget they need
to pack a hefty punch.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:39.140
We don't need any silly bombs.
I can blow them away with my magic.

00:06:43.020 --> 00:06:45.900
He's not a Student of Avan, too, is he?

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.900
He is. This is Popp, the Mage.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.820
Lend him to me.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.660
Huh? Does he show promise?

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:57.750
Just the opposite. I've never seen
a Mage who looked so weak.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.540
If I don't do something,
he's going to die out there.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.670
O-Oh really?

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:09.050
Leave it to me. I'll train him with
a Special Hard Course worse than Avan's.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.550
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.010
What did you just say, Lord Hadlar?!

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.390
A full-on assault.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:23.900
They're sure to attempt to destroy
the Dark Flame and Dark Ice Spires.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.860
When they do,
they'll split up their forces.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:32.780
We will gather all of our armies
and wipe out Dai and his companions.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:33.660
Oh?

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:38.290
But Flazzard is sure to complain
about not being able to take credit.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:43.500
He's a monster that I created
using Legendary Forbidden Magic.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:48.000
He's basically my son.
He won't disobey his father.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:53.840
Interesting. At last,
my Dragon Legion can play a role.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.470
Wait, Baran. I have something else
I need you to do.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:07:59.560
What?

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:07.150
Mystvearn is fighting Carl Kingdom,
but they're proving quite resilient.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:11.030
I'd like you to take down Carl.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:15.160
You just said "all of our armies!"

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:19.870
And defeating the Hero should take
precedence over other invasions!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.040
Isn't that why the Six Legion Commanders
were summoned?!

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:30.880
Or is there some other reason
you don't want me to face this boy, Dai?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.600
Say what you will, the order still stands.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:45.520
Very well. I'll let you give the orders
this time, Dark Commander.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.940
I'm off to Carl Kingdom!

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:54.900
<i>What's so special about Baran that Lord
Hadlar gives him preferential treatment?</i>

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:59.280
<i>Not even Baran can
overthrow Carl that easily!</i>

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.700
<i>We must kill Dai before that happens!</i>

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:07.460
We shall make Valge Island their grave!

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:19.220
W-What the hell?! This is Nayle Village!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.600
This is the
Instant Transmission Spell, Zoom!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:27.770
You think of your destination
and it takes you there instantly.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:30.900
Popp!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:32.820
Matoriv, you...

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:37.240
Yo, Leira, long time no see.
I ran into Maam.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.450
Maam?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:43.540
She's gotten all curvy,
just like you when you were young!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.040
Why are you here with Popp?

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:49.920
It's complicated. I figured
I'd give his butt a well-deserved kick.

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:50.920
Come on!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:52.050
Ow, ow, ow!

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.250
Popp...

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:54.880
-Get over here.
-I get it, I get it!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:55.840
Shut up.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:58.640
He seems like a mean old man.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.180
He is.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:04.810
But if he's teaching,
I know Popp will grow stronger.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:09.940
He was once called
the greatest of all Mages.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.520
But he can be a little quirky.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.660
Is this really going to
let me use powerful magic?!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:24.740
Idiot, this is basic stamina building
before training. It's a warm-up.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.500
Better pick up the pace
or you'll get trampled!

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:35.550
See? You can do it.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:49.480
Frizz doesn't work well under water!
Find another way out or you'll drown!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:56.860
Wanna know how? You don't use a spell!
You release your Magic Power itself!

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.240
From your entire body!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.870
Whoops. Did I read him wrong?

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:22.470
Dai!

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:29.020
Let's stop.
Your wounds haven't fully healed.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.390
You're pushing yourself.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:35.150
I'm fine. I can't rest
when Popp is out there training!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:42.070
Besides, Matoriv said this training
would help me to fight Flazzard!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:45.240
<i>I'll never forgive Flazzard!</i>

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.990
<i>Just when I finally found Leona!</i>

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:53.210
I'll defeat him!
And I swear I'll rescue Leona!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:57.050
<i>I've never seen Dai so emotional before.</i>

00:11:57.210 --> 00:12:00.880
<i>Princess Leona must
really be important to him.</i>

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.130
All right! Here we go!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:04.220
Come on!

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:11.390
MAGIC BULLET GUN

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.400
FIVE FINGER FLARES

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.250
No more!

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:33.580
How pathetic.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.790
A whole day together and
your Magic Power increased just that much?

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:43.340
You should be ashamed a hundred year-old
like me beat a youngster like you.

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.840
A hundred?!

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.550
I guess that's all for today.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:56.060
I'm heading back to Papnica.
Use your own Zoom spell to come back.

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.110
What?! There's no way I can do that!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:05.150
It's easy. You flew from the river to
the shore by releasing your Magic Power.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:11.330
If you have a clear image of your
destination, Zoom's a piece of cake.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:16.290
But from the river to the shore and
from here to Papnica is totally different.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:20.090
Beside, even if I learn Zoom,
it's useless in battle!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:21.710
Get your head out of your ass!

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:27.640
A Mage's magic is
for protecting his companions!

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:34.430
Thwarting danger using numerous spells
and knowledge is what a Mage does!

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:37.230
Don't you realize,
if you could had used Zoom,

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:42.150
you could have rescued your companions
from the burning Balloon Ship?!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:46.530
Don't talk like you're anything more
than a novice!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:51.870
If you can't clear a challenge this easy,
you'll just drag everyone down.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.910
Even if you join the fight,
you'll just end up dead.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:14:00.420
You can just wander around
the Dark Forest for eternity!

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:01.670
Wait!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.340
Dammit! You bastard!

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:10.640
Ah, Sir Matoriv! I've completed the bombs!

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:14.390
No good. Do over. The design sucks.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:15.430
The design?

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:17.850
Go for a more sophisticated shape.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:23.440
They're going to get blown up,
so who cares about the design?

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.820
Yo! Looks like you're making progress.

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.120
Matoriv!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:35.120
Once you can cut the unseen,

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:39.120
your blade will become
three, or even five times more powerful.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.420
Keep it up.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.920
Wait, where's Popp?

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.670
Him? He's probably dead by now.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.380
What?!

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:48.420
That little brat. What a pampered weenie.

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:51.760
His type never try
unless they're desperate.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:55.100
That's why I left him
on the other side of the world.

00:14:56.720 --> 00:15:00.900
Avan was always too soft for his own good.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.020
He could never properly train
a crybaby like that.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:07.740
He needs my kind of tough love.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.860
<i>Sadist...</i>

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.290
<i>Can you hear me?!</i>

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.620
Little Disciples of Avan!

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:24.210
<i>How long do you think
you can hide from me?! Huh?!</i>

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:31.550
<i>You don't think your Princess
is safe all frozen, do you?!</i>

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:37.100
<i>Unfortunately, her life force
is getting drained in this ice!</i>

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:42.600
<i>Your Princess's life ends
tomorrow at sundown!</i>

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:46.020
<i>Hurry on back! Come on!</i>

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:50.240
Leona's going to die?!
I won't let that happen!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:16:00.580
Get real! I'm not dragging everyone down!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.790
Unless you defeat Flazzard
by sundown tomorrow,

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:09.460
<i>the Princess's life force will be drained
by the Forbidden Magic ice and she'll die.</i>

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:14.430
<i>But charging in during the day
is just what the enemy wants.</i>

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:16.510
We strike tonight.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:20.810
Light the fuse,
and in five seconds... Kaboom!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.440
We only have two, so be careful.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:27.360
I guess we'll have to use
the ugly bombs after all.

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:31.570
If these don't work, we'll have to
destroy them by sword or magic.

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:36.870
What are you talking about?!
I made them! They're foolproof!

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:39.910
<i>That's why we're worried.</i>

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:44.710
How will we get to Valge Island?
Our Balloon Ship has sunk.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:48.710
I have a small boat I use for fishing.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:53.300
I'll fly it across with my magic,
just above the ocean.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.260
That'll get us over the whirlpool.

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:59.010
Exactly. But the boat only holds four.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:01.810
Then it'll be me and Maam and...

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:07.150
Me, of course! I built the bombs!
Of course I'm going!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.900
I'll go, too!

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:14.110
Fighting for the Princess is
what the Papnica Troika are for!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:15.610
Wait, Amy.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.040
Apollo, you shouldn't move yet!

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:25.080
I cannot let Dai and his friends
carry our burden.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.500
I shall go in your stead.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.710
No! I will!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:31.300
Hold on a second, you two.

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.380
The fourth seat is already taken.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.720
Popp!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:42.470
Sorry to keep you waiting.
I couldn't get a clear image of the cave.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:46.480
I made it to the Papnica temple
with my Zoom spell,

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.650
but from there it was a real pain
and it took a while.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.990
But I made it back.

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:01.280
Good. You're the fourth.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.170
Nothing beats Maam's Midheal!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:13.920
This is the last help you'll get from me.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:18.760
It'd be easy with Zoom,
but I've never been to that island.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:24.270
If Popp does it, he'll take you to the top
of Valge Tower inside the field.

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.100
It's enough, Uncle.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:28.640
Thank you for everything, Matoriv.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:31.020
Save the thanks for when you win, idiot.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.230
Right! I swear we'll win!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.070
Everybody onboard!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.070
Listen...

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.950
if I survive this,
I'd like to continue my training.

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:47.330
If I quit after all that,
it'd look like I ran off like some coward.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:52.630
Like I'd let you run.
I'm still not finished with you.

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:55.340
Later, Mentor!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.010
What do you mean by "Mentor"?

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:00.090
Master Avan is my one and only master.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.510
A master and mentor are different!

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.640
Why are you splitting hairs like that?

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:05.970
Here we go.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.020
When did Gomechan sneak onboard?

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.160
Go with the blessing
of the great gods of Papnica.

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:27.450
Don't die out there,
forgotten mementos of Avan.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:34.880
This is fast!
We'll make it to the island in no time!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.630
I guess they don't call him
a Grand Sorcerer for nothing!

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.840
Listen, I was just thinking...

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.100
how do we stop?

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:46.430
Oops.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.430
Is something wrong?

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:52.230
I forgot to think about how they'd stop.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.480
W-What do we do?!

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.650
D-Don't ask me!

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:02.570
We'll crash! We'll crash! We'll crash!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:04.490
Woosh!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.990
That's it! A Woosh spell as a brake!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.160
Cast Woosh, Popp!

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:13.830
Don't you have Woosh
in your Magic Bullet Gun?!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.210
Use Woosh! Use Woosh! Use Woosh!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:17.460
Woosh!

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.350
Ow, ow, ow...

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.100
Oh come on, Mentor.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:33.060
He talks big, but he always
screws up where it counts!

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:37.310
I tried to cast Woosh and it worked!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:39.610
Let's split up.

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.530
I'll go to the Dark Flame Spire
with Baduck.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:43.240
Right.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.410
Then Maam and I'll take
the Dark Ice Spire.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.290
Once the two Spires are destroyed
and the field is down,

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:50.620
we charge into Valge Tower!

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:58.040
Sorry about that. Come with us, Gomechan.

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.170
Let's go.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:02.130
Stay safe, you two!

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:10.970
Here they come. The sad little flies
into the spider's web.

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:15.390
Mystvearn, are your soldiers ready?

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.760
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.760
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:35.980
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:35.980
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.270 --> 00:22:43.940
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.270 --> 00:22:43.940
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:46.490
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:46.490
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:52.620
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:52.620
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:57.290
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:57.290
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.450 --> 00:23:01.500
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.450 --> 00:23:01.500
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:13.800
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:13.800
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:13.970 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:36.990
<i>Dai and his friends managed
to reach Valge Island.</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:39.960
<i>They split up
and headed for the two Spires.</i>

00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:42.120
<i>But, waiting for them there</i>

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:47.000
<i>is the full force of the Dark Army
that anticipated the attack.</i>

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:52.010
<i>As Dai and his friends fall into peril,
an unexpected individual appears.</i>

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:55.050
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.220 --> 00:23:57.100
<i>"The Death-Defying Savior"</i>

00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:59.310
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
